jovin-harness is new code. It follows design ideas published in the JoVin research
workbench (disposable hardened containers, privilege-separated checking and
hash-bound receipts) but contains no source code from JoVin or Renigma.

The sandbox image is built from the official Python container image, which is
distributed under its own licenses (Python Software Foundation License and the
licenses of the Debian packages it contains).
